Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.91,0:00:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.21,0:01:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.27,0:01:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.21,0:01:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, you little runt.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.61,0:01:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's your daily gruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.01,0:01:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.01,0:01:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.29,0:01:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.43,0:02:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Where do these guys get all their ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.51,0:02:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Pegasus?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.23,0:02:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,A thousand pardons, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.63,0:02:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Gorgonzola cheese and the world's finest
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.89,0:02:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Fruit juice. Along with\Na copy of my favorite
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.09,0:02:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,comic book Times like\Nthis are more precious
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.87,0:02:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,to me than any other You\Ndo realize that, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.81,0:02:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But the prisoner has escaped Which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.57,0:02:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The boy we imprisoned in the\NNorth Tower I have our men
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.55,0:02:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,searching the island But so\Nfar there's no sign of him Ooh,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.69,0:02:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess he didn't appreciate\Nmy hospitality Well, no matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.21,0:02:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I know exactly where\Nour little escapee is heading.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.47,0:03:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll seek out Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.21,0:03:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Computer, request data on the status\Nof the Duel Monsters Tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.09,0:03:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Six hours have passed since\Nthe dueling contests began.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.61,0:03:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Twelve of the participants\Nhave been eliminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.63,0:03:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Those that were defeated\Nand lost their starships
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.17,0:03:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,are being removed from the island by boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.89,0:03:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And what of Yugi Moto?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.09,0:03:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi Moto has to date\Ngained five star chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.07,0:03:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.07,0:03:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I expected no less.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.81,0:03:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He is determined to work his way up in the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.11,0:03:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,standings in order to\Ngain entry to my castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.95,0:03:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Which is exactly what I\Nwant little Yugi to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.37,0:03:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll just keep our spy cams trained\Non our star duelist. Sooner or later,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.09,0:03:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,the little runaway prisoner will\Nconfront Yugi for reasons of his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.75,0:03:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Very wise, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.29,0:03:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, the boy's escape\Nplays right into my plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.75,0:03:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And I do have such special\Nplans in store for Yugi today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.57,0:03:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Plans I hope he'll find\Nas entertaining as I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.89,0:04:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.95,0:04:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you already\Nwon five star chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.57,0:04:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.48,0:04:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,pretty soon you'll have\Nthe ten you need to get
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.79,0:04:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,into Pegasus' castle\Nand rescue your grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.59,0:04:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I had more star chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.31,0:04:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.59,0:04:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're doing fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.50,0:04:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be able to help\Nyour sister out soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.61,0:04:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I sure hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.29,0:04:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity's really counting on me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.57,0:04:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And I won't let her down
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.67,0:04:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.71,0:04:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.51,0:04:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me, somebody please!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.71,0:04:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, let go of me, somebody help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.05,0:04:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, kid, we're coming
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.05,0:04:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Help, you gotta help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.47,0:04:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Let that kid go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.71,0:04:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Help, help me, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.09,0:04:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on the big guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.97,0:04:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Not too shabby.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.35,0:04:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm off the big guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.19,0:05:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Put me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.83,0:05:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit squirming, you little brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.71,0:05:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard him, natal head.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.23,0:05:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Put the kid down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.79,0:05:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.51,0:05:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This is none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.45,0:05:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,This duelist lost his star chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.83,0:05:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And the rules say he's to\Nbe kicked off the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.71,0:05:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But I didn't lose my chips in a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.67,0:05:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,They were stolen from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.77,0:05:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,My cards, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.83,0:05:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care what lame\Nexcuse you have, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.89,0:05:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You need star chips to duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.19,0:05:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,and you haven't got any, so\Nyou're shipping out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.51,0:05:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.83,0:05:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are my orders from Pegasus himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.05,0:05:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that big creep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.45,0:05:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I see we follow him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.53,0:05:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kimo, what'd you catch?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.51,0:05:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Just another loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.37,0:05:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, buzz off!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.01,0:05:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,They may be shipping me out,\Nbut I'm still Evil Underwood.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.79,0:05:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Bug-dualistic extraordinaire!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.07,0:05:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But I didn't even get a\Nchance to duel. Hey! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.93,0:05:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.43,0:05:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.53,0:05:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What did the guy who stole\Nyour star chips look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.29,0:06:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I couldn't see his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.19,0:06:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It was covered with a bandana.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.35,0:06:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But he was a little guy, and\Nhe challenged me in the meadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.33,0:06:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,He challenged you to a duel monsters game?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.45,0:06:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.36,0:06:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,but as soon as I put my star\Nchips and duel monsters deck down,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.35,0:06:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,he snatched them up and ran off with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.31,0:06:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't be shipped\Noff the island for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.67,0:06:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get your star chips back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.35,0:06:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This boat leaves in exactly 30 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.97,0:06:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone without a star chip ships out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.71,0:06:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'll get his\Nchips back by that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.85,0:06:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't let you bully\Nhim out of the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.09,0:06:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.00,0:06:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll catch that little thief\Nand bring him to justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.43,0:06:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe me, kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.41,0:06:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,you can count on us to track him\Ndown and get those star chips back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.11,0:06:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But who are you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.29,0:06:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the guys that are\Ngoing to save your chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.25,0:06:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.16,0:06:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You got the brilliant mind of Joey Wheeler\Non the case, and I always get my man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.11,0:06:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if he's just a kid. Onward, troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.91,0:06:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what's your brilliant mind\Ntelling you now, Sherlock?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.35,0:06:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, beats me. Right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.89,0:06:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,the only thing my brilliant mind is\Ndoing is giving me a brilliant headache.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.65,0:07:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe we should stake\Nout the scene of the crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.49,0:07:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.81,0:07:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Think the thief will come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.43,0:07:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He just might, and we can put our heads\Ntogether and plan in the meantime.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.83,0:07:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but don't forget one\Nof those heads is joeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.85,0:07:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's sort of like subtracting one brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.49,0:07:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I found you at last, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.11,0:07:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be the kid we were looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.21,0:07:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I can handle him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.15,0:07:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.06,0:07:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're twice his size.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.17,0:07:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Just try me, you big dork.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.61,0:07:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Back off, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.59,0:07:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And hand over the starship you\Nswiped from that other duelist.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.49,0:07:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.40,0:07:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I know what this kid's after.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.07,0:07:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He wants to duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.39,0:07:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you want, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.59,0:07:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to duel me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.83,0:07:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, you better believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.75,0:07:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.17,0:07:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is Yugi going to the\Ntrouble of dueling this guy
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.87,0:07:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,when we can just take those\Nstar chips away from him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.39,0:07:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.30,0:07:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,sometimes I don't think even Yugi knows\Nwhy he does half the stuff he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.65,0:07:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.56,0:07:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's kind of weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.47,0:08:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think it has something to\Ndo with his Millennium Puzzle?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.69,0:08:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.49,0:08:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, how many star chips will you\Nwager to wipe you out? Five. Then five.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.71,0:08:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,it is but only because i think i know\Nwhy you're doing this i don't care
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.93,0:08:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,what you think yugi because i think\Nyou're gonna lose what does yuki see
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.03,0:08:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That we don't? It's like he's looking\Ninto the other player's soul. Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.35,0:08:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,So small.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.41,0:08:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see from here that that\Nkid's gonna get his butt kicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.37,0:08:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.28,0:08:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,but Yugi should hurry if he plans to get\Nthose star chips back to the boat in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.45,0:08:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.83,0:08:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll win the chips and we'll be\Nback at the dock with time to spare.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.39,0:08:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.79,0:08:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.11,0:08:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're gonna pay for what\Nyou did to my big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.33,0:09:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.24,0:09:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,you've gotta leave now\Nif you're gonna make the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.61,0:09:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,boat for the big tournament\Nat Dula's Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.27,0:09:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, open the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.33,0:09:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Seto?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.63,0:09:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going, Mokuba. Not going? Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.35,0:09:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no point.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.59,0:09:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, no point?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.69,0:09:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Kid, I am in no condition to duel anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.31,0:09:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.69,0:09:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You always say cards are power, and\Nyou've got all the strongest cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.71,0:09:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I lost my duel with Yugi, I\Njust don't know what I think anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.29,0:09:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.20,0:09:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels as if I lost a\Npiece of myself that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.15,0:09:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But Seto, you're the\Nbest. You're the champ.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.03,0:09:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Not since the day I was defeated by Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.49,0:09:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.73,0:09:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going away for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.33,0:09:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how long I'll be gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.25,0:09:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.16,0:09:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It was always your favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.33,0:09:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.24,0:09:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.91,0:09:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I don't know who I am anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.05,0:09:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.25,0:09:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.63,0:09:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You broke up my family, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.97,0:09:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I'm gonna break you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.65,0:10:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,My first card is the man-eating plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.65,0:10:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.43,0:10:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll counter your attack with the\NWinged Dragon, Guardian of the Fortress.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.05,0:10:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.11,0:10:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad choice, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.75,0:10:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,My man-eating plant will\Neat your dragon alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.63,0:10:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So now you're finally gonna pay for\Nwhat you did, Yuki and your stupid
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.33,0:10:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon's gonna be plant food. Man-eating\Nplant attack. Fireball attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.43,0:10:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,my monster lost you can't win a duel with
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.13,0:10:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,cards that don't rightfully\Nbelong to you how
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.03,0:11:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,could your heart ever live in cards that
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.07,0:11:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,belong to someone else\Nbe quiet i don't believe
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.85,0:11:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,in that part of the card stuff you keep
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.73,0:11:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,preaching about cards\Nhave nothing to do with
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.31,0:11:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Heart. It's all about\Npower. Yes, I can see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.73,0:11:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,now i sensed a connection\Nto kaiba you're his
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.75,0:11:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,brother you're mokuba\Nhow did you know well
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.93,0:11:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter. Look,\Nit is Kaiba's little
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.67,0:11:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,brother that's right\Nsetto kaiba is my brother
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.31,0:11:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,and he's the best duelist that there ever
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.25,0:11:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,was but now thanks to yuki he's gone and\Npegasus is trying to take over kaiba corp
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.05,0:11:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,pegasus wants kaiba corp i don't know what
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.79,0:11:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,you did to my big brother\Nwhen you dueled Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.57,0:11:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,but ever since that defeat,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.37,0:11:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,he hasn't been the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.29,0:11:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He ran away because of you, and with\Nhim gone, Pegasus moved right in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.03,0:11:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Some Kaiba Corp executives invited him\Nto some kind of secret board meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.05,0:11:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, gentlemen, let's see if\NI understand your proposition.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.99,0:11:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto Kaiba has abandoned\Nhis corporate station,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.35,0:11:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,and now you five wish to\Nseize control of Kaiba Corp.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.47,0:12:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You then want to merge with my company,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.41,0:12:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,and you'd like me to handle\Nany messy details, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.79,0:12:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Precisely, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.70,0:12:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.61,0:12:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,With our money and your leadership, we\Nwill easily take control of Kaiba Corp.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.55,0:12:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Do tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.33,0:12:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,For our plan to succeed, Kaiba\Nmust be taken out of the picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.71,0:12:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Permanently.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.79,0:12:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,However, there is one catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.67,0:12:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,As for the corporate bylaws,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.21,0:12:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,only a Kaiba family member can\Nlegally control Kaiba Corp.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.11,0:12:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,To that end, Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.55,0:12:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We recommend kidnapping\NKaiba's brother, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.35,0:12:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,In nay, he will control Kaiba\NCorp, but we will control him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.51,0:12:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Do these things for us, and we will lay all\Nof Kaiba Corp's technology at your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.87,0:12:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.78,0:12:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The elder Kaiba shall meet with an accident,\Nand the younger Kaiba will be captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.21,0:12:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent, but we have\None final condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.01,0:12:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The brat who beat Kaiba has\Ntarnished Kaiba Corp's good name,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.63,0:12:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,and we must insist that you restore it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.33,0:12:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, how fortuitous.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.13,0:12:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Plans for me to duel Yugi\Nare already underway.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.43,0:12:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, to show that I truly am\Nthe man for this job, Kimo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.25,0:13:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,bring me young Kaiba, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.27,0:13:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go, you creeps.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.95,0:13:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard everything, and when I tell\Nmy big brother, you're gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.49,0:13:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.65,0:13:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,this is how efficiently you can\Nexpect me to handle our business.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.83,0:13:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Young Kaiba is captured,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.35,0:13:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi will be defeated, and Seto\NKaiba will bother us no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.29,0:13:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.55,0:13:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto deserted me because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.99,0:13:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.81,0:13:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba, your brother hasn't deserted you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.29,0:13:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He's searching for himself. Liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.03,0:13:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell it to my monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.39,0:13:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Crocodilus!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.27,0:13:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Battling me won't bring your brother back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.45,0:13:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And we want to stop\NPegasus as much as you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.11,0:13:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,He's taken my grandfather prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.99,0:13:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.05,0:13:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus is the bad guy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.53,0:13:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you see that, you crazy little kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.49,0:14:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.40,0:14:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to protect my brother's company,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.19,0:14:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and Yugi's the one Pegasus has\Nto beat in order to take it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.23,0:14:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.79,0:14:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba is trying to save his brother's\Ncompany by defeating Yugi in a duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.11,0:14:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,so Pegasus doesn't get\Nto face Yugi at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.69,0:14:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.87,0:14:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, what do I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.53,0:14:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.51,0:14:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, what did you mean, Pea?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.93,0:14:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,If Mokuba can keep\NPegasus from beating Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.75,0:14:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,then he won't be able to\Ntake over Kaiba's company.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.35,0:14:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that must be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.11,0:14:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.67,0:14:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can't beat you, I'll be\Ndisqualified. My star shifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.31,0:14:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold up, you little punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.35,0:14:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.93,0:14:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never save Kaiba\NCorporation that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.65,0:14:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Your big brother is just confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.25,0:14:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,After I defeated Kaiba in\Nour duel, I opened his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.09,0:14:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I removed from him all the dark\Ninfluences that clouded his thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.75,0:15:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And actions free of that evil essence.\NKaiba is struggling now. Your brother
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.33,0:15:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,realizes that his way wasn't the\Nright way and he's searching his heart
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.79,0:15:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,for answers and you know in your heart\Nwhat you're doing isn't the right way
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.61,0:15:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,either but then what can i do you can\Nstart by trusting in me and together
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.15,0:15:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,we will defeat pegasus\Ni promise you we can
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.23,0:15:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,only bring pegasus down\Nif we stick together
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.99,0:15:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll help you protect your brother,\NMokuba, but you've got to help us, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.33,0:15:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to go back\Nand return those cards
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.39,0:15:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,and star chips to the\Nkid you stole them from.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.07,0:15:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.49,0:15:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'll take on Pegasus together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.69,0:15:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We've only got three minutes\Nleft till the boat leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.19,0:15:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get going, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.17,0:15:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.71,0:15:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.91,0:15:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I've gone over it a dozen times in my\Nmind, but I still can't figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.17,0:15:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,How was a kid who came out of nowhere\Nable to defeat a champion like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.43,0:15:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I've run computer simulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.47,0:15:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,probability scenarios,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.95,0:16:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,and quantum analysis of our duel,\Nbut I still don't have the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.93,0:16:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I had clearly been dominating the match.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.53,0:16:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,My blue-eyes white dragon\Nripped through his forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.95,0:16:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I was on the verge of winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.93,0:16:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But Yugi wouldn't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.91,0:16:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Against all odds and with absolute\Nfaith in his grandfather's deck,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.45,0:16:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,he somehow drew the one card\Nthat assured his victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.91,0:16:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Exodia, it's not possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.25,0:16:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Exodia, obliterate!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.23,0:16:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always believed Duel Monsters\Nwas a game of sheer power,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.83,0:16:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,but Yugi claims that\Nthe cards have a heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.61,0:16:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds crazy, I know,\Nbut could Yugi be right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.21,0:16:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there really a heart of the cards\Nthat can affect the outcome of a duel?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.89,0:16:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that how he won?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.91,0:16:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The only way I'll know for\Nsure is to face Yugi again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.93,0:16:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And these new portable\Nholo-generators will enable
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.35,0:16:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,me to challenge him no\Nmatter where I find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.55,0:16:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can just get to...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.89,0:16:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Settle, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.83,0:16:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We know you're in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.11,0:17:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the door or we'll break it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.53,0:17:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.03,0:17:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,On your feet. Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.19,0:17:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus would like to\Nhave a few words with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.27,0:17:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet he would, but it'll take\Nmore than you two goons to grab me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.65,0:17:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,This can go easy, or we can\Nsnap you in two. Wise guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.55,0:17:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never take me alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.25,0:17:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.37,0:17:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He jumped.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.65,0:17:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody could survive a fall like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.15,0:17:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like he did our work for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.89,0:17:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that just leaves\Nthe rest of the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.63,0:17:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus was very clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.95,0:17:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He wants to deck with the\Ndeadly Blue-Eyes White Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.83,0:17:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, we're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.51,0:17:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna just make it. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.59,0:17:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you I'm not gonna row,\Nso quit bugging me! The boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.87,0:17:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's already left.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.23,0:18:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's the sleazy low\Nlight that shipped them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.39,0:18:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.47,0:18:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Those losers are on their way back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.69,0:18:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.49,0:18:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It hasn't been a half hour yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.63,0:18:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Tough luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.54,0:18:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus sets the schedule here. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.15,0:18:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna give you a flat top.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.13,0:18:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to call the boat back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.75,0:18:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to return that\Nkid's star chips to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.25,0:18:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The star chips!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.05,0:18:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What gives?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.27,0:18:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,A bunch of those star chips\Nbelong to Yugi, you big joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.27,0:18:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I am so sorry, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.95,0:18:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You losers should keep a tighter grip\Non your valuables, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.45,0:18:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Then accidents like that wouldn't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.37,0:18:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's go, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.21,0:18:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Back to the cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.12,0:18:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This little ingrate is\Na special guest of Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.17,0:18:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Maximillian Pegasus,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.41,0:18:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,and he's been invited to attend a special\Ndinner in his honor back at the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.97,0:18:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Mokuba?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.77,0:18:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi! Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.83,0:18:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.74,0:18:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have three of my star chips left.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.97,0:19:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I challenge you to a duel, and\Nif I win, Mokuba comes with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.13,0:19:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.04,0:19:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know why you'd risk\Nyour chips for this punk,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.57,0:19:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,but if that's how you want to\Nwaste your last star chips,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.29,0:19:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Then meet me back at Arena\N146 in exactly four hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.49,0:19:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have your duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.09,0:19:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.07,0:19:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Thinien Head?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.03,0:19:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.27,0:19:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.73,0:19:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba, put him down now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.23,0:19:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll consider it if you win the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.59,0:19:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'll beat you, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.19,0:19:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I never said I would duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.13,0:19:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There is your opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.75,0:19:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,He's an old friend who's\Ndying to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.83,0:19:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He met with an unfortunate\Nend earlier today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.29,0:19:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,but he's come back just to duel you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.01,0:19:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.37,0:19:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.47,0:19:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.11,0:19:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.85,0:19:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And this time you don't\Nstand a ghost of a chance.
